# custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: 「<string $s1>」の、<br>名前を変更するんだね？<br>どんな名前にするんだい？
#. de: Den Namen von <string $s1> ändern? Von mir aus. Welcher neue Name soll es denn sein?
#. fr: Changer le nom de <string $s1><nbsp>? Oui, c'est possible.
#. macro: <string $s1> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_TALK_ACTOR_02:1"
msgid "Dissatisfied with the name “<string $s1>”? I understand. Pray allow me to review your registration..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 競走羽の名前を変更するには、<br>手数料として、2,000ギルが必要です。
#. de: Bitte beachte, dass die Umbenennung eines Renn-Chocobos 2.000 Gil kostet.
#. fr: Vous devez vous acquitter de 2<nbsp>000 gils de frais pour effectuer cette modification.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_ERROR_002_02:1"
msgid "A fee of 2,000 gil is required for each name change."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 「<string $s1>」でよろしいですか？<br>変更手数料 ：<kilo $n2 ",">ギル
#. de: Möchtest du deinen Renn-Chocobo in <string $s1> umbenennen? Die Umbenennung kostet <kilo $n2 "."> Gil.
#. fr: Confirmer le nom “<string $s1>”<nbsp>?<br>(Frais de changement<nbsp>: <kilo $n2 "<nbsp>"> gil<if ($n2 <= 1)><else>s</if>)
#. macro: <capitalize>{$s1}</capitalize> — the content with its first letter in upper case (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <kilo $n2 ","> — a number with a thousands separator; value = number parameter 2, separator = , (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_RENAME_Q1:1"
msgid "Change your race chocobo's name to <capitalize>{$s1}</capitalize> for <kilo $n2 \",\"> gil?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: はい
#. de: Ja
#. fr: Oui
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_RENAME_A1:1"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. ja: いいえ
#. de: Nein
#. fr: Non
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_RENAME_A2:1"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. ja: うん、その子にお似合いの名前になったんじゃないかな！<br>「<string $s1>」を、<br>これからも、可愛がってあげてね！
#. de: Ich muss sagen, das klingt wie ein Sieger ... <string $s1>. Viel Erfolg mit dem neuen Namen - Ehre dem Ersten!
#. fr: Ça lui va très bien, si vous voulez mon avis<nbsp>! J'espère que vous continuerez à prendre grand soin de <string $s1><nbsp>!
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s1> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_RENAME_DONE:1"
msgid "Excellent choice, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>. I think all here would agree that <string $s1> is a far better name."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 君の競走羽の名前を変更するんだね？<br>どんな名前にするんだい？
#. de: Du möchtest deinem Renn-Chocobo einen neuen Namen geben? Welcher soll es denn sein?
#. fr: Vous voulez lui donner un nouveau nom, c'est bien cela<nbsp>?
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_TALK_ACTOR:1"
msgid "Dissatisfied with your race chocobo's name? I understand. Pray allow me to review your registration..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……あれ？<br>競走羽登録されたチョコボがいないみたいだよ。
#. de: Hm? Du hast ja gar keinen Renn-Chocobo registriert.
#. fr: Tiens<nbsp>? Je ne trouve aucun chocobo de course qui vous soit attribué dans le registre...
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_ERROR_001_01:1"
msgid "Beg your pardon, but did I misunderstand your request? I can find no record of a race chocobo currently registered to you..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 名前を変更できるのは、<br>競走羽登録されたチョコボのみです。
#. de: Hier können nur Chocobos umbenannt werden, die als Renn-Chocobos registriert sind.
#. fr: Vous pouvez uniquement modifier le nom d'un animal enregistré en tant que chocobo de course.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_ERROR_001_02:1"
msgid "You can only change the name of a registered race chocobo."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……ごめんね。<br>君の持ってるお金じゃ足りないみたいだ……。
#. de: Wenn ich dich richtig verstehe, <i>möchtest</i> du die Gebühr bezahlen, du <i>kannst</i> sie bloß nicht bezahlen? Tut mir leid, aber ich bin kein Kreditunternehmen. Komm wieder, wenn du genug Geld zusammengekratzt hast.
#. fr: Euh<nbsp>! Je suis au regret de vous dire que cette procédure dépasse votre budget...
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_ERROR_002_01:1"
msgid "I do not wish to embarrass you, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>, but it seems you lack the requisite gil..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……ごめんなさい、<br>その名前を登録することはできないみたい。
#. de: Tut mir leid, aber mit diesem Namen kann ich deinen Rennvogel nicht zum Rennen zulassen.
#. fr: ... Pardon, mais vous ne pouvez pas appeler votre animal ainsi.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_ERROR_003_01:1"
msgid "Ah... Forgive me, but it seems that the name you requested is... How shall I put this? Ineligible."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 単語の組み合わせによっては、<br>競走羽の名前として、使用できないものがあります。<br>ほかの組み合わせをお試しください。
#. de: Die gewünschte Namenskombination kann nicht als Chocobo-Name benutzt werden. Bitte wähle eine andere Kombination.
#. fr: Certaines com<shy>bi<shy>nai<shy>sons de mots sont interdites. Veuillez trouver un autre nom.
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_ERROR_003_02:1"
msgid "The word combination you selected is prohibited. Please select a different name."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ……ふむ、前と同じ名前だね。<br>それじゃあ、今回は変更しないでおくよ！
#. de: Aber ... das ist ja der gleiche Name wie vorher. Hast du es dir vielleicht anders überlegt? Gut, mir soll's recht sein.
#. fr: ... Hum, c'est le même nom qu'avant, si je ne m'abuse. Pas de changement, donc<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscChocoboRaceRename_00231:TEXT_CMNGSCCHOCOBORACERENAME_00231_ERROR_004_01:1"
msgid "Then you wish to retain your race chocobo's current name, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>? Very well."
msgstr ""
